(F) A list of each exemption, credit, and preferential assessment granted or allowed for the property as of the creation of the notice of assessment;
(G) The estimated tax savings from all exemptions, credits, and preferential assessments granted or allowed for the property calculated using the sum of all millage rates which were imposed on such property in the previous tax year;
(H) A brief description of the methods and manner by which the taxpayer may appeal the current assessment;
